    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "4. Admit.\n5.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 608,
      "end": 621,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that he is a contractual employee in an Agency named as Creative Services in Mission Vatsalya Scheme District Child Protection Unit and has been falsely roped in, in the present matter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 622,
      "end": 850,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Mission Vatsalya Scheme District Child Protection Unit",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 742,
          "end": 796
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2852732539176941
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "6. As per FIR the main allegation against the petitioner was that he forged some signature and misappropriated the amount involved in the present matter whereas after his signature were sent for forensic science laboratory verification, which was found otherwise.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 851,
      "end": 1115,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27248507738113403
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "7. Learned State counsel further submits that the petitioner is totally involved in the present matter without any authority and seeks time to get instruction.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1116,
      "end": 1276,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17280694842338562
    },
    {
